stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> NoKey: paper is stored
  NoKey --> Keyed: import keeps the file's key<br/>or one is generated
  Keyed --> Frozen: written to a .bib<br/>(export freezes it)
  Frozen --> Frozen: exported again, unchanged
  Keyed --> DryRun: keys rekey
  Frozen --> DryRun: keys rekey
  DryRun --> Keyed: you stop here, nothing changed
  DryRun --> Renamed: apply, with a reason
  Renamed --> Keyed: new key, old key kept as an alias
  note right of DryRun
    Lists the manuscripts
    that cite the old key
  end note
  note right of Renamed
    Old manuscripts still
    resolve the old key
  end note
